%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': { 'fontSize':'13px'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant OS
    participant SignalHandler
    participant Shutdown
    participant PipelineRunner
    participant BatchExecutor
    participant CurrentBatch
    participant CheckpointManager
    participant LockManager
    participant Storage
    participant Logger

    OS->>SignalHandler: SIGTERM or SIGINT

    SignalHandler->>Shutdown: trigger_shutdown()

    Shutdown->>Shutdown: set _shutting_down = True

    Shutdown->>Logger: info("Shutdown signal received")

    Shutdown->>PipelineRunner: notify_shutdown()

    PipelineRunner->>PipelineRunner: check_shutdown_flag()

    alt In Fetch Loop
        PipelineRunner->>Logger: info("Stopping fetch loop")
        PipelineRunner->>BatchExecutor: stop_fetching_new_batches()

        BatchExecutor->>BatchExecutor: Break fetch loop
        BatchExecutor->>Logger: info("No new batches will be fetched")

    else Processing Current Batch
        PipelineRunner->>Logger: info("Finishing current batch")
        PipelineRunner->>CurrentBatch: continue_processing()

        CurrentBatch->>CurrentBatch: Transform remaining records
        CurrentBatch->>Storage: write_bronze()
        Storage-->>CurrentBatch: Bronze complete

        CurrentBatch->>Storage: write_silver()
        Storage-->>CurrentBatch: Silver complete

        CurrentBatch->>Storage: write_gold()
        Storage-->>CurrentBatch: Gold complete

        CurrentBatch->>Logger: info("Current batch completed")
        CurrentBatch-->>PipelineRunner: Batch finished
    end

    PipelineRunner->>CheckpointManager: save_checkpoint(current_state)

    CheckpointManager->>CheckpointManager: Serialize state:<br/>- last_offset<br/>- processed_count<br/>- last_batch_id

    CheckpointManager->>Logger: info("Checkpoint saved")

    CheckpointManager-->>PipelineRunner: Checkpoint saved

    PipelineRunner->>LockManager: release_lock()

    LockManager->>LockManager: stop_heartbeat()
    LockManager->>Logger: info("Heartbeat stopped")

    LockManager->>LockManager: validate_owner_and_release()
    LockManager->>Logger: info("Lock released")

    LockManager-->>PipelineRunner: Lock released

    PipelineRunner->>PipelineRunner: cleanup_resources()

    loop For Each Resource
        PipelineRunner->>PipelineRunner: await resource.aclose()
        PipelineRunner->>Logger: debug("Resource closed")
    end

    PipelineRunner->>Logger: info("Cleanup complete")

    PipelineRunner->>Shutdown: confirm_shutdown_complete()

    Shutdown->>Logger: info("Graceful shutdown complete")

    Shutdown->>OS: exit(0)

    Note over OS,Logger: Graceful Shutdown Sequence:<br/>1. Receive signal<br/>2. Set shutdown flag<br/>3. Stop new batches<br/>4. Finish current batch<br/>5. Save checkpoint<br/>6. Release lock<br/>7. Cleanup resources<br/>8. Exit(0)

    Note over CheckpointManager,Logger: Checkpoint State:<br/>- run_id<br/>- last_offset<br/>- processed_count<br/>- last_batch_id<br/>- timestamp

    Note over PipelineRunner,Storage: Key Guarantees:<br/>✓ Current batch commits atomically<br/>✓ No data loss<br/>✓ Resume from checkpoint<br/>✓ Lock released properly<br/>✓ Resources cleaned up
